  99:Libs/mbedtls/library/ecp.c **** /*
 100:Libs/mbedtls/library/ecp.c ****  * Counts of point addition and doubling, and field multiplications.
 101:Libs/mbedtls/library/ecp.c ****  * Used to test resistance of point multiplication to simple timing attacks.
 102:Libs/mbedtls/library/ecp.c ****  */
